    <h1 class="hero__title"><em>Smritivan</em>Earthquake<br>Museum</h1>
    <p class="hero__desc">11,500 sq. mt. of memory, resilience, and hope — spread across seven immersive blocks chronicling the story of the 2001 Kutch earthquake and Gujarat's extraordinary rebirth.</p>
    <div class="hero__stats">
